 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Let <span data-math=\"p\">p</span> represent the statement, “My roommates  ordered pizza,” let <span data-math=\"q\">q</span> represent the statement, “I ordered wings,” and let <span data-math=\"r\">r</span> be the statement, “Our friends came over to watch the game.” Translate the following statements into words.\n",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 496961,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"\\text{~}r \\to (p \\vee q)\">\\text{~}r \\to (p \\vee q)</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\text{~}r \\to (p \\vee q)\"></span></p>\n<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: My roommates ordered pizza.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: I ordered wings.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span>: Our friends came over to watch the game.</p>\n<p>Translate <span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}r\"></span> as :Our friends did not come over to watch the game.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" \\to \"></span> is the conditional, which will be translated “if…then.”</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" \\vee \"></span> is the inclusive or.</p>\n<p>The comma before “then” shows that the statements in parentheses belong together.</p>\n<p>If our friends did not come over to watch the game, then my roommates ordered pizza or I ordered wings.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "If our friends did not come over to watch the game, then my roommates ordered pizza or I ordered wings."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 496962,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"(p \\wedge q) \\to r\">(p \\wedge q) \\to r</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"(p \\wedge q) \\to r\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" \\wedge \"></span> is the conjunction, which will be translated “and.”</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" \\to \"></span> is the conditional, which will be translated “if…then.”</p>\n<p>The comma before “then” shows that the statements in parentheses belong together.</p>\n<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: My roommates ordered pizza.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: I ordered wings.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span>: Our friends came over to watch the game.</p>\n<p>If my roommates ordered pizza and I ordered wings, then our friends came over to watch the game.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "If my roommates ordered pizza and I ordered wings, then our friends came over to watch the game."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 496963,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"\\text{~}(p \\vee r)\">\\text{~}(p \\vee r)</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}(p \\vee r)\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" \\sim \"></span> is the negation symbol. Replace the symbol with “It is not the case that…”</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" \\vee \"></span> is the inclusive or.</p>\n<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: My roommates ordered pizza.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: I ordered wings.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span>: Our friends came over to watch the game.</p>\n<p>It is not the case that my roommates ordered pizza or our friends came over to watch the game.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "It is not the case that my roommates ordered pizza or our friends came over to watch the game."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
